<BaseLayout title="Submit a Product for Review | Buy Better Finds" description="Manufacturers and brands can contact Buy Better Finds about independent hands-on product review consideration.">
<article class="article">
<div class="eyebrow">For brands and manufacturers</div>
<h1>Submit a Product for Review</h1>
<p class="lead">Introduce your product to the Buy Better Finds Review Team.</p>
<p>We welcome product submissions for consideration in our independent hands-on review program. We focus on practical products that help shoppers make better purchasing decisions.</p>
<h2>How to submit</h2>
<p>Email <a href="mailto:info@buybetterfinds.com?subject=Product%20Review%20Submission">info@buybetterfinds.com</a> with your brand and product name, a link to the product, key features, intended audience, and whether you propose a gift or a returnable loan. We will respond if the product is a fit.</p>
<p><a class="btn primary" href="mailto:info@buybetterfinds.com?subject=Product%20Review%20Submission">Email a product submission →</a></p>
<h2>Our editorial standards</h2>
<ul>
<li>Submitting or supplying a product does not guarantee a review or publication.</li>
<li>We do not promise positive coverage, ratings, or recommendations.</li>
<li>We independently decide what to test, write, and publish.</li>
<li>Any free or discounted product, loan, payment, or other material relationship relevant to a review will be clearly disclosed.</li>
<li>Affiliate commissions do not determine our review conclusions.</li>
<li>We do not publish hands-on claims without firsthand product testing.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Shipping and privacy</h2>
<p>Please do not ship unsolicited products. If a submission is accepted, shipping arrangements will be provided privately. No personal residential address is published on this website.</p>
<h2>Questions?</h2>
<p>Contact the <strong>Buy Better Finds Review Team</strong> at <a href="mailto:info@buybetterfinds.com">info@buybetterfinds.com</a>.</p>
<p>See our <a href="/disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a> and <a href="/why-we-recommend/">editorial standards</a>.</p>
</article>
</BaseLayout>